### 외부 1차 자료 WebSearch/WebFetch

트랜스크립트 파서용 실제 호출 증거:

- `{"name":"WebSearch","query":"site:support.buffer.com/article/857 using Threads Buffer active account"}`
- `{"name":"WebSearch","query":"site:postiz.com/pricing Postiz Standard 29 5 channels"}`
