정본: `docs/openclaw-auto-osmu-prd-v2.3-gpt-codex.md` · `v2.3.0` · SHA-256 `cf1b60357b1f59948557684d8cd5e08c6cad88026c143c2cf6d7bb0dd46bebf1`.

